+# CI Closure Addendum — #2405 (2404/merge ghost red) — closes the stranded work order
+
+- **Purpose:** closure instrument for WO #2405, filed per the acceptance criteria of #2485 ("stranded pair #2405 + #2368 still need closure after this lands ... any future receipt-class submission using the flag"). This is the **first operational use** of the `closesOriginalIssue` opt-in landed by PR #2490 (`6fcefe0`).
+- **Why this addendum exists:** the original closure receipt `docs/bridge/bridge-20261029-ci2405-closure-receipt.md` (PR #2427, landed `2edec67` 2026-10-29T03:42:42Z) carried `Refs #2405` — not `Closes #2405` — because `buildBridgePrBody`'s spec-only heuristic downgrades every docs-only payload's linkage (mechanism gap #2485). Direct anonymous-API ground truth confirmed #2405 stayed `open` with `closed_at: null` after the receipt landed, polluting P0-drainage scans with a phantom red (Invariant 5) and feeding the verdict-stall class (#2345/#2350).
+
