+## Closure event
+
+This addendum is submitted with `closesOriginalIssue: true` and `originalIssueNumber: 2405`, so the bridge PR body emits `Closes #2405` and GitHub auto-closes the work order on merge — completing the receipt-closure lane end-to-end: detect (#2405) → triage receipt (#2427) → mechanism fix (#2485, PR #2490) → instrumented closure (this addendum).
